# Base origin of the local Remote Deck agent.
#
# Used by `npm run dev` for the loopback proxy, by production builds for the
# REST base URL, and by the activity WebSocket. Change this when the agent
# listens somewhere other than the default loopback address.
#
# Copy to `.env` (gitignored) and adjust:
VITE_AGENT_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8765
